source: tests/cli/snapshots.rs
---
Update an app

Usage: vendo apps update [OPTIONS] <appId>

Arguments:
  <appId>  

Options:
      --name <displayName>         New display name
      --profile <name>             Use a specific account profile
      --debug                      Enable verbose request diagnostics
      --role <role>                Comma-separated capability: source, destination (derives permissions)
      --permissions <permissions>  Comma-separated granular permissions. Overrides --role.
      --credentials-file <path>    Replace credentials from a JSON file
      --config-file <path>         Replace config from a JSON file
      --json                       Output raw JSON
      --output <field>             Print a single field (e.g. id)
  -h, --help                       Print help

Examples:
  $ vendo apps update <appId> --name "New name"
  $ vendo apps update <appId> --credentials-file rotated.json
